Original commit body from d20f506:

The SQUASH_TEMPLATE.md approach didn't work - Forgejo templates
only apply to web UI merges, not API merges.

This fix passes the merge_message_field directly to the merge
API call, bypassing the template system entirely:

1. Combine TITLE and DESC into a proper commit message format
2. Pass as merge_message_field in the squash merge payload
3. Forgejo uses this message for the squash commit

If this body appears in the final commit, the fix worked.
